title: n64-mr-backup-z64-python
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Gustavo
    family-names: Franco
    alias: gufranco
repository-code: https://github.com/gufranco/n64-mr-backup-z64-python
abstract: >-
  Builds verified Mr. Backup Z64 Zip 100 disk images from a Nintendo 64 ROM
  collection: 8.3 naming that stays readable, FAT16 construction, provably
  minimal disk count, byte-reproducible output, and printable catalogues.
  Distributes no copyrighted content, only the hashes needed to identify it.
keywords:
  - nintendo-64
  - mr-backup-z64
  - retrocomputing
  - fat16
  - preservation
